  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經濟學實習",
    "sub_ename": "ECONOMICS PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在使學生了解整個經濟社會的運作機制，尤其特別著重在個體經濟的領域。同時也介紹一些經濟學家常用的基本分析工具，以協助學生了解日常生活與職業之經濟相關課題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to help you understand the vast and important economic world, especially focusing on Microeconomics. To introduce the tools that economists use to help you in your personal life and career.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
